Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 02:34:18 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 18/58] phy: apple: Add T6050 DisplayPort and USB combo PHY

Add the T6050 DisplayPort/USB combo PHY and four-clock display crossbar profile. Carry the current Type-C, USB2, USB3 PIPE sequencing, and teardown behavior from the published T6050 source.

Source snapshot: t6050-gpu ee68abb105200e99636a5edfc647a5cfc1d89954
Integration base: 9cbdd0734d9e186c5f5f5949a21b909d10c2571b

Signed-off-by: Dj <hey@djdev.me>
Signed-off-by: Erik Bourget <erik@ebourget.net>
